[1–2 sentences addressing the most obvious objection or limitation. Acknowledging uncertainty increases credibility. "This assumes X — if X doesn't hold, the finding changes to Y."]

---

## So what / Resolution

[2–4 sentences: what does this mean? What decision does it enable? What should happen next?]

---

## Call to action

